  id: 
  playerChoiceText: 'Are you okay, really? '
  lines:
  - speaker: Mandla
    text: "I\u2019m tired, bro. Everyone thinks I\u2019m lazy but I\u2019m out here
      grinding every day."
  - speaker: Player
    text: "You shouldn\u2019t have to carry all that alone."
  - speaker: Mandla
    text: "Yeah, well... life didn\u2019t ask what I can carry. Just threw it on
      me anyway."
  - speaker: Mandla
    text: 'Anyways lets stop feeling sorry for ourselves . i have the mother of all
      jobs. Identity theft. Huge risk '
  - speaker: Player
    text: 'identity theft??? '
  - speaker: Mandla
    text: "Think about it and If you get caught, you could lose everything\u2026
      maybe even go to jail.But the payout? R16000! That clears your debt instantly."
  - speaker: Player
    text: "R16000\u2026 that\u2019s everything."
  - speaker: Mandla
    text: "Instant ruin\u2026 or instant freedom.Are you ready for this?"
  unlockTask: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5752bebb6844c7447bccc6bc7929f180, type: 2}
